{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14282-something-i-just-noticed-in-the-preview-text","id":14282,"title":"Something I just noticed in the preview text...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-19T14:10:46-08:00","id":14282,"title":"Something I just noticed in the preview text...","content":"On page 161, it has this text under the description of the results of a Compromise roll:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Dramatic Failure: The demon\u2019s Cover has been damaged severely, perhaps beyond repair. For a</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">moment, the God-Machine or its agents know exactly where the character is. Lose a dot of Cover and</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">choose from the following Conditions (or create a new one with Storyteller approval): Blown, Betrayed,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">or <b>Hunted</b>. Alternately, you may make two permanent glitch rolls (see p. XX) as the Infrastructure that</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">maintains the character\u2019s Cover frantically tries (and fails) to fix her mistake. Also, take a Beat.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Failure: The character\u2019s Cover has been weakened. The God-Machine or its agents have a sense of her</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">general whereabouts and activity. Lose a dot of Cover and choose one of the following Conditions (or</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">create a new one with Storyteller approval): Flagged, Surveilled, or <b>Hunted</b>. Alternately, roll for a</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">permanent glitch (see p. XX).</span></span> </div> </div> </div>Now, I was wondering if the second instance of Hunted was supposed to instead be Blackballed, since Surveilled is a lesser version of Hunted, and I could easily see Flagged as a lesser version of Blown (and Blackballed as a lesser version of Betrayed, for that matter).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T14:36:19-08:00","id":14297,"title":"","content":"No, that's correct. Do note, though, that it's a Condition <i>such as</i> those listed, so if Blackballed is a better fit, that's fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T14:50:33-08:00","id":14308,"